# Figures are regenerable from the manifests, so panels/ is not committed. The cb++ candidates are
# the exception and live in their own directory: they are the evidence behind a claim the site
# makes, and a claim whose evidence 404s is worse than no claim. Git cannot re-include a file
# inside an ignored directory, and every figure shares the *_rich.png suffix, so a negation
# pattern could not have selected them -- hence a separate folder.
images/panels/


